text = "WASD / arrows   Move       Shift   Sprint
Space   Hold breath
E   Interact       F   Flashlight
B   Replace battery       Q   Throw rock
Mouse   Aim       R   Restart checkpoint

Stand still to recover exertion.
Release your breath before your air runs out."

